# Build context of the Dockerfile is the repository's root: the image is built from the sources and the lockfile only.
# Local installs and build output would replace what the image installs and builds itself.
node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
# Test and coverage output.
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
# The design copy is never served or imported by the app.
design
# Local configuration and secrets never enter the image (next build does not read them either).
.env*
# Git's data, and the checkout of the backend whose CI scripts and pinned tools this repository runs: neither is part
# of the app.
.git
.backend
# Repository tooling the build does not read: CI, dependency updates, the scan's ignore file, the pins of the backend
# and of the API contract, the scripts that read them, the Makefile and the documents.
.github
.gitignore
renovate.json
.trivyignore.yaml
.backend-commit
api
scripts
Makefile
README.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
